// An example config for the server. The server refuses a config file owned by another
// user or writable by its group or others, and a checkout can leave this file 0664, so run
// it from a copy only you can write: `cp docs/config.example.zon config.zon`,
// `chmod 600 config.zon`, then `coalition-connection config.zon`. `zig build test` starts
// the server with such a copy of this file, so it is always one the server accepts. Every field is required and unknown fields are refused; src/config.zig has the
// limits.
.{
    // The local socket nginx reaches; the server doesn't open it yet.
    .socket_path = "/run/coalition-connection/app.sock",
    // The most client connections at once, at most http_connections_max.
    .connections_max = 1024,
}
